<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.78 BILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.78 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the rest of the month was 5.78 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for July 01		    10,150</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for July	     6,520</p>
<p> Average reserves to June 26			  7,115</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,783</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
